      "created_at": "2025-03-05T06:38:35.749Z",
      "cooked": "<p>On Lead list view how to remove the default filter</p>\n<p>when ever I am loading a list view page system adding filter as mentioned below in image</p>\n<p>we don’t have any customisation related to list view</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/6/763b828521ba887a4b144a212da642a8c766ec8b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/763b828521ba887a4b144a212da642a8c766ec8b\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-03-05 at 12.03.15 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/6/763b828521ba887a4b144a212da642a8c766ec8b_2_690x172.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-03-05 at 12.03.15 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"gRVQ7TYNSPcu1wrhayuqEE7anJF\" width=\"690\" height=\"172\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/6/763b828521ba887a4b144a212da642a8c766ec8b_2_690x172.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/6/763b828521ba887a4b144a212da642a8c766ec8b_2_1035x258.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/6/763b828521ba887a4b144a212da642a8c766ec8b_2_1380x344.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F4F4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-03-05 at 12.03.15 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">2864×714 209 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>If I am applying another filter and reloading a page above filter will come again as mentioned in below image</p>\n<p>Onload of the listview it will append the filter</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/c/4c055a3ec6e4516ddc1a4a072171038824df802a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/4c055a3ec6e4516ddc1a4a072171038824df802a\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-03-05 at 12.06.16 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/c/4c055a3ec6e4516ddc1a4a072171038824df802a_2_690x172.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-03-05 at 12.06.16 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"aQvKQ386YhWRHUlZ4vPiP2Z4WBs\" width=\"690\" height=\"172\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/c/4c055a3ec6e4516ddc1a4a072171038824df802a_2_690x172.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/c/4c055a3ec6e4516ddc1a4a072171038824df802a_2_1035x258.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/c/4c055a3ec6e4516ddc1a4a072171038824df802a_2_1380x344.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-03-05 at 12.06.16 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">2864×714 159 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I want to remove this default filter <code>Last Updated On - Timespan - Last 90 Days</code></p>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ncp\">@NCP</a></p>",
