      "id": 460033,
      "username": "volkswagner",
      "name": "volkswagner",
      "created_at": "2025-03-05T11:39:36.369Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don’t see that as a default in V14 nor V15. There must be a browser cache or server cache issue.</p>\n<p>Try:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">bench --site your.site.name clear-cache\n</code></pre>\n<p>Try logging in as a different user, do you see this filter?</p>",
