      "id": 460798,
      "username": "Viral_Kansodiya",
      "name": "Viral Kansodiya",
      "created_at": "2025-03-12T03:58:21.036Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/volkswagner\">@volkswagner</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/gien_vicencio\">@Gien_Vicencio</a></p>\n<p>Hi, I was connected with a Frappe team member, and they said this filter will automatically be applied if the doctype contains a very large amount of data.</p>\n<p>Here, we have more than 500K leads, so by default, this is working. There is no option to change it.</p>",
